          "pause_before": 0.4
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator_history",
          "text": "He cuts your money in half. Then in half again.",
          "pause_after": 0.45
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator_history",
          "text": "Cut halfpennies and farthings were everyday change."
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator_history",
          "text": "The cross runs to the coin's edge, and pieces were cut along it."
        },
        {
          "who": "narrator_history",
          "text": "That's what 'farthing' means: a fourth part."
        }
